From bb201dc02525a5fa75a8e9f39349fe6d6bfdde05 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bechir Bejaoui <noreply@hydraetl.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 12:11:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(cli): validate --strict reads nested steps and checks
 expression syntax

- Read steps through TransformParser so both 'steps:' and
  'transformations: steps:' layouts are recognised (examples showed 'none').
- Check filter/calculate expressions with pandas' own pre-parser
  (no evaluation); a syntax error now fails validation with exit code 1.
- Non-strict validate is unchanged.
- New tests: tests/test_validate_strict.py (21 cases).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
